{"id":"322071002cb7e79b","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-dual-characteristic-conversion.md","title":"双枚举索引与特征索引可有效互换","display":"thm-dual-characteristic-conversion — 双枚举索引与特征索引可有效互换","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-dual-characteristic-conversion","aliases":["20-thm-dual-characteristic-conversion"],"display":"thm-dual-characteristic-conversion — 双枚举索引与特征索引可有效互换","chapter":"2","section":"2.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Remark 2.3.2","source_printed_pages":[33],"source_pdf_pages":[69],"depends_on":["[[20-df-characteristic-indices]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-dual-characteristic-conversion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-dual-characteristic-conversion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dual-characteristic-conversion — 双枚举索引与特征索引可有效互换"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Remark 2.3.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>33</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>69</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3850151d9f29cbf4\" href=\"?note=3850151d9f29cbf4\" title=\"20-df-characteristic-indices\">20-df-characteristic-indices</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span> 为已定义的全可计算函数族限制；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,e,j\\in\\omega\">\\(i,e,j\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3850151d9f29cbf4\" href=\"?note=3850151d9f29cbf4\" title=\"20-df-characteristic-indices\">20-df-characteristic-indices</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dual\\text{-}characteristic\\text{-}conversion}\\vdash\n\\exists u,v\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall A,i,e,j\\ \\bigl[(\\operatorname{CharInd}(i,A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{DualInd}(u(i),A))\\land(\\operatorname{DualInd}(\\langle e,j\\rangle,A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{CharInd}(v(\\langle e,j\\rangle),A))\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dual\\text{-}characteristic\\text{-}conversion}\\vdash\n\\exists u,v\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall A,i,e,j\\ \\bigl[(\\operatorname{CharInd}(i,A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{DualInd}(u(i),A))\\land(\\operatorname{DualInd}(\\langle e,j\\rangle,A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{CharInd}(v(\\langle e,j\\rangle),A))\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>u 编译两个半判定程序，分别等待 φ_i(x)=1 和 φ_i(x)=0，然后配对其索引。v 编译在两枚举间并行搜索 x 的程序，出现于 W_e 则输出 1，出现于 W_j 则输出 0。正确 promise 下恰一边出现。u,v 本身在任意索引上全定义，因为它们仅产生程序代码；错误 promise 下生成程序不保证是特征函数。</p>\n<p>来源：Remark 2.3.2；印刷页 33；PDF 第 69 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-characteristic-indices","status":"resolved","id":"3850151d9f29cbf4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-characteristic-indices]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}$ 为已定义的全可计算函数族限制；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic-indices","status":"resolved","id":"3850151d9f29cbf4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-characteristic-indices]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-characteristic-indices]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"i,e,j\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dual\\text{-}characteristic\\text{-}conversion}\\vdash\n\\exists u,v\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall A,i,e,j\\ \\bigl[(\\operatorname{CharInd}(i,A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{DualInd}(u(i),A))\\land(\\operatorname{DualInd}(\\langle e,j\\rangle,A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{CharInd}(v(\\langle e,j\\rangle),A))\\bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1773,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-193","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-dual-characteristic-conversion]] — 章 2；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-193","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-dual-characteristic-conversion]]"}],"outgoing":["3850151d9f29cbf4","8ba6597a854c206f","e343870c773cb68e"]}